\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De eo quod mandastis de cohabitatione cum fratribus peccantibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 audi apostolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dicentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut fidelis peccator iudicandus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; r\u246 \'f6mische Nummerierung nur bis can. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XVIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (14\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
