\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Luna \u8729 \'b7I\u8729 \'b7 in k. ian. du\u281 e litterae cum punctis propriis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a l\u8729 \'b7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Obseruant per totum annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 primam diem lun\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omni anno per totum martyrologium quod Hieronymus scripsit duas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 tantum litteras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut scriptae sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 obserua per XUIIII annos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Wiederholung des Textes, beginnend mit: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Luna VIIII in kl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ian\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 duae litterae cum punctis propriis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; Rest der Seite leer.  }

