\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 VI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mai obiit Uuenilo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oratio ante altare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Oremus domine Iesu Christe ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 per merita sanctorum tuorum reliquiae hic sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut per eorum merita dignetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mihi indulgere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnia peccata mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

