\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bruno Monachus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (Ps.-Paterius B):\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber testimoniorum veteris et novi testamenti (Supplementum in Paterii librum testimoniorum, Ct, Sap\endash Io)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Paterius a Brunone Monacho auctus, In Cantica canticorum (Erg\u228 \'e4nzung des Textes von Paterius zu Ct; vgl. PL 79, 905-916): >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Incipiunt capitula qu\u281 \'ea desunt in priori parte Paterii de Canticis canticorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < (zu Ct 1,1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Potest per os dei unigenitus filius designari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui sicut brachium eius dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuncta per eum pater operatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... (letzte elf Zeilen auf 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  in figurativer Schriftfl\u228 \'e4che) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Qu\u281 \'ea habitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ct 8,13). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u280 \'cacclesia in hortis habitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [folgende Wortumstellungen durch zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssische Verweiszeichen angezeigt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ad predicationem eius per electorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suorum animas anhelat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; arabische Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung 1\endash 20, 14. Jh.; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer; 
