\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Glossen zum Alten Testament: (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini incipiunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [K\u252 \'fcrzungsstrich \u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  nachgetragen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 glose in Genesi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prologvs idest praefatio et dicta praefatio quasi praelocutio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [nachgetragen] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prologo Geneseos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Praesagium idest praesentia uel signum futurorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gn: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In libro Geneseos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Exzerpt aus Hieronymus, Hebraicae quaestiones in libro Geneseos 1,1 (CCL 72, S. 3); Zusatz zu Gn 1,19: (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et factum est uespere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (am Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); weitere Zus\u228 \'e4tze auf 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ex; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -13\