\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini incipit codex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a beato Hisidoro Spanense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 episcopo de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quinque libris Moysi ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 planatvm a tot diversis avc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 toribvs in vnvm collectvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lvcvlentivsque expositvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit praefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Historia sacrae legis non sine aliqua}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 praenuntiatione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  futurorum gesta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ac nostri temporis insegniter eloquenti Gregorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit praefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio zu Gn: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit capitularium libri Genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Praemissio operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item de hisdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XXXI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De benedictionibus patriarcharum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit capitularium libri Genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Genesim: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Creatura caeli et terrae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 intellegamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit textvs libri Genesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio ... terram; \u252 \'fcber der Zeile in Griechisch, mit lat. Buchstaben (Gn 1,1). Principium Christus est, sicut ipse in euangelio Iudaeis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Exodum mit vorangestellter Capitulatio (bis Idc ebenso); (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Leviticum (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Numeros; (154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Deuteronomium (stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt); (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Iosue; (176\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Librum Iudicum; (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -190\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Librum Ruth: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit expositio libri Rvth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Videamus nunc et Ruth. Habet enim et ista tipum ecclesiae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quae adimpleuit is\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui pollicitus est per filium suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iesum Christum regem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; daneben \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  in tironischen Noten; die betreffenden Kapitel der biblischen B\u252 \'fccher meist auf den Versoseiten in der Kopfzeile und bei Beginn am Rand mit roten arabischen Zahlen nachtr\u228 \'e4glich vermerkt, 14./15. Jh. 
