\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -154\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Ps.-?)Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula ad Massonam episcopum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistola Isidori episcopi ad Masonem episcopum de restauratione sacerdotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domno sancto meritisque beato fratri Masoni episcopo Isidorus episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f4\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Ueniente ad nos famulo nostro}}\plain \f4\i\lang1024\fs24  uiro religioso Nec\u281 \'eatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sententia cuius potius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 extat auctoritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dicit sub die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [ie] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 k\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno quarto regni domini Uuiterici regis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Wiederholung von Teilen des Textendes von anderer unge\u252 \'fcbter Hand.   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: PL 83, 899-902 (Ep. IV). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az y D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 az\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Index, 124; CPL 1209; CPPM 2A, 1076. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mordek\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Kirchenrecht und Reform, S. 221 Nr. (13) und S. 227f. Anm. 62. \endash  Zur umstrittenen Echtheit vgl. auch Jos\u233 \'e9 C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mart\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u237 \'ed\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 n\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 in: Te.Tra. 2 (2005), S. 389f. und 393 (in Handschriftenliste diese Hs. genannt).  }

