\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit expositio missae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum dicit sacerdos: >Qui tecum uiuit et regnat deus in unitate spiritus sancti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 vult populum credere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et omnes respondeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
