\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber officiorvm sancti Ysidori episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prefacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Domino meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 adhibetur auctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finit praefatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; endet: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XLIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De carnium vel piscium usu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber I endet: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prohibuerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit prologus libri II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 di\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quoniam origines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 persequamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exlicit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula de libro II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber II endet: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 firmaretur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finit liber officiorum secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Rest der Seite leer.
