n \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 domini hora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 nona usque in ascensa domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Idest pars prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In vigilia domini de nona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Lectio epistolae beati Pauli apostoli ad Romanos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pavlvs servus Christi Iesv}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  ... (Rm 1,1-6). >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omilia lectionis eivsdem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 < (am Rand: >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 <) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gaudeamus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [korr}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 .}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ],}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  fratres et}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[39].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 let\u281 \'eamur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in domin