\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 Hieronymus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber quaestionum hebraicarum in Genesim (gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit decerptio de libro haebraicarum quaestionum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio fecit deus caelum et terram (Gn 1,1). Plerique estimant Hilarius uero in expositione}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuiusdam psalmi adfirmat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui seruientes altari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uiuant de altari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; darunter Zitat aus Hieronymus, De situ et hominibus locorum hebraicorum liber: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bethsaida piscina in Hierusalem quae uocabatur \u960 p\u961 ?o\u946 \'dfa\u964 t\u953 ?\u954 ?e }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et a nobis interpretari potest pecualis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et nomen accepit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CCL 72, ed. Paulus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lagarde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (1959), S. 3-56. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , BHM 2, 200; CPL 580. \endash  Zitat in PL 23, 884D-885A; auch in Beda, In Ezram et Neemiam, lib. III (CCL 119A, S. 345 Z. 261-267).  }

