\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titelseite: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Haec hic insunt epistulae beatissimi apostolici papae urbis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Romae Leonis transmissas diuersis pro munimen defensionemque Catholicae fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Index der 72 Briefe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Capitula epistularum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XXXUI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Expliciunt capitula epistularum qu\u281 \'ea sanct\u281 \'ea Calchedonensi synodo sunt pr\u281 \'eamiss\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipiunt capitula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 epistularum qu\u281 \'ea post synodum miss\u281 \'ea sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; endet nach Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 LXXII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt capitulae epistularum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Briefe: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit ordo textus que earum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : PL-Nr. 24 (= Edition Nr. 2; JK 421); (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 23 (=3; JK 420); (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 III\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 29 (= 7; JK 424); (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 30 (= 8; JK 425); (11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 U\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\u8218 \'82Tomus Leonis\lquote ): 28 (= Collectio Novariensis de re Eutychis Nr. 5; JK 423; CPPM 2A, 4/6a); (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 UI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 35 (= 5; JK 429); (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 UII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 34 (= 13; JK 428); (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 UIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 33 (= 12; JK 427); (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 UIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 32 (= 10; JK 426); (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 X\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 37 (= 15; JK 431); (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 38 (= 16; JK 432); (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 44 (= 18; JK 438); (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 45 (= 23; JK 439); (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 51 (= 24; JK 444); (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XU\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 50 (= 19; JK 443); (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ep. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XUI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 54 (= 9; JK 445); 