\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Translatio sancti Nicolai}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De translatione sancti Nycolai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gloriosa sanctorum merita dum pio ac frequenti studio recoluntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a fidelibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 venerabiliter celebremus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Translatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Est Varis ciuitas Apuli\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 donec honorifice locaretur in eadem ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 prestante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Epilog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sublatum est autem sacratissimum corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et restituti sunt sanitati per merita et intercessionem beati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nycolai\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui retinet premia eterni regni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt, 13. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 in quo viuit et regnat omnipotens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 rex in secula seculorum. Tu et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; darunter zwei Hexameter von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Suplicibus Nicolae pater succurr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ? korr.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Benigne existens fortis protectio temporum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (lies: tempore?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Prolog und Anfang der Translatio sowie Schluss des Epilogs nach dieser Hs. in Appendix XXII (wie oben), S. 210. \endash  BHL 6187, 6189}

