\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Passio sanctae Margaritae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Passio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit passio sancte Margarete virginis et martyris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post passionem et resurrectionem domini nostri Iesu Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et gloriosam ascensionem eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 saluabantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a languoribus suis et credebant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [L\u252 \'fccke im Wort]; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epilog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego enim Theothimus tuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reliquias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut in suis precibus nos memorare dignetur ante dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iesum Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cui honor est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am oberen Rand Schreibervers (etwas sp\u228 \'e4tere Hand): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Qui scripsit scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 manus eius sit benedicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Mombritius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sanctuarium 2, S. 190-196, dazu S. 691f. \endash  BHL 5303. \endash  Schreibervers in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wattenbach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Schriftwesen, S. 504; Colophons 23206-23211.    }

