\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quomodo uel quando impleuit Christus septem gradus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primus gradus lector, quando apperuit librum Esaie prout }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (lies: prophete) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et dixit spiritus domini super me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quintus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (richtig Quartus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 gradus diaconus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quando lauit pedes discipulorum suorum et tersit linteo quo erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 praecinctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Septimus gradus episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quando leuauit manus super capita discipulorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suorum et benedixit eos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
