\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sacrificio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus et salvator noster Iesus Christus admonet nos}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  semper\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 suscipere sacramenta sui corporis et sanguinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sic enim ait\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen amen dico uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 6,54-59). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et iterum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ego sum panis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Io 6,51-52); (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) aus Gregorius Magnus, Dialogorum liber IV c. 60,2-61,1, 57,2, 60,1 (mit Einschub wie Florus Lugdunensis, Expositio missae 69): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Haec namque singulariter uictima ab aeterno interitu animam saluat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam post uincula libertatem quaerere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Isidorus Hispalensis, De ecclesiasticis officiis, liber I c. 18,11 (mit l\u228 \'e4ngerem im Text gekennzeichneten Augustinuszitat): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sanctus Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sacrificium pro defunctorum fidelium requie offerre}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 fiat ipsa damnatio est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einsch\u252 \'fcbe aus Sanctus Cyprianus, De dominica oratione c. 18; Ambrosius Mediolanensis und Hilarius Pictaviensis.
