\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (13.-15. Jh.)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (191\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag 13./14. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Dominus uobiscum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequencia sancti ewangelii secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Gloria tibi domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore factum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regressus est a Iordane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 3,21-4,1; auf Notenlinien mit Hufnagelnotation). (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag 13./14. Jh.: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De corona domini secundum Johannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore apprehendit Pylatus Iesum et flagellauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 portans spineam coronam et purpureum uestimentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Io 19,1-5); darunter Nachtrag 15. Jh., Oratio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In visitatione beate virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus qui nos presentem festiuitatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Corpus Orationum 1914); (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag 14. Jh., Orationes: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In natiuitate domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus qui per beate Marie uirginis partum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Corpus Orationum 1964) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Herhardi confessoris.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Da quesumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 omnipotens deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ut qui beati Herhardi confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 coluimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Blasii episcopi.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preces populi tui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quesumus domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 clementer exaudi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Barbare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Intercessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quesumus domine deus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 beate Barbare virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 confessione percipere mereamur per dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Lectiones: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum Iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore stabat iuxta crucem Iesu mater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Io 19,25-27) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Secundum Iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In illo tempore erat dies festus Iudeorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Io 5,1-5); (199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge 15. Jh., Orationes: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deus qui hodiernam diem beati Mauri confessoris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Corpus Orationum 1680) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto Brictio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (folgt Rasur)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus qui nos beati Briccij confessoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui salutis eterne beate Marie virginitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Corpus Orationum 2113a); Anf\u228 \'e4nge diverser Lectiones: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In aduentu domini de beata virgine ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Missus est angelus Gabriel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tempore pascali ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Stabat iuxta crucem Iesu mater eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 //; (200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) //\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 peccatorem diuertisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 stans autem Zacheus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 saluum facere quod perierat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lc 19,7-10; auf Notenlinien mit Hufnagelnotation); Orationes: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Erhardi oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui per electos famulos tuos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sebastiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus qui beatum Sebastianum martyrem tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Corpus orationum 1472 a) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Leonhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Deus qui largiflue bonitatis consilio ecclesiam tuam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Corpus Orationum 1774); (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In die dedicationis ewangelium.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dominus vobiscum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sequencia sancti ewangelii secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In illo tempore ingressus Ihesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Lc 19,1-10; auf Notenlinien mit Hufnagelnotation); (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Inicium sancti ewangelii secundum Matheum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber generacionis Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui uocatur Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Mt 1,1-16) (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Introitus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ite benedicti et electi in uiam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item missa est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; Messformular auf Notenlinien mit Hufnagelnotation, stark gek\u252 \'fcrzt bzw. nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt; folgen Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge 15. Jh. von verschiedenen H\u228 \'e4nden, z.\~T. stark verblasst mit den Anf\u228 \'e4ngen diverser Lectiones.}

