\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Anfang der Sammlung fehlt, Text beginnt mitten im 3. Kapitel von Sessio I) // \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro celebratione tunc futuri concilij generalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 inde confecto huiusmodi seriei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In nomine domini Amen. Tenore presentis publici instrumenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cum vero finis intraret septenii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ipse autem reuerendissimus dominus legatus mandatum apostolicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ceterum cum unumquodque eo direccius atque intensius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Preterea cum premissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut autem qua morum et gestus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad obuiandum controuersijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sane quoniam opus aliquod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacrosancta generalis sinodus Constantiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 iustitiam et equitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 de indulto huiusmodi mentionem. Datum Constancie secundo nonas Iulij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Porro quia nonnunquam lingwa subdola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
