\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pro salute eorum qui vicia fugere cupiunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 unicuique tribuat ex hijs que habet quantum ei opus est in Christo Iesu domino nostro. Amen. Tractatus de proprietatibus religiosorum editus per venerabilem magistrum Heinricum de Hassia sacre theologie professorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
