\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ad declarationem distinctionum 40e et 41\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Queritur utrum cognatio carnalis vel vinculum affinitatis inpediat matrimonium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 post mortem sine coniugia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 permaneat ut habetur ibi idem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Finis anno domini millesimo 449 in Wienna etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Der Text geh\u246 \'f6rt zu den Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen zur Lectura Mellicensis.
