\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Ps.-Albertus de Saxonia}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (\u8218 \'82Anonymus Tabarroneus\lquote ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sophismata}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u220 \'dcber dem Text von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Istud sophisma durat per quinternium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Totus sortes est minor sorte}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Probatio: pes sortis est minor sorte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quedam est substantia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Communia \u8218 \'82Feminae\lquote , s. unten; 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer; (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 extremitate et minori est impossibile}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 non est alia in re ab eo cuius est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer. (44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omnis fenix est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 facta ad opposicionem concedenda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt sophysmata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Edition: (Teil 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ): Sten \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ebbesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Thirteenth-century logic. Selected texts, in: Cahiers de l\rquote Institut du Moyen-Age grec et latin 65 (1995), S. 213-361, hierzu S. 303-318, zur Hs. und zum Namen \u8218 \'82Anonymus Tabarroneus\lquote  vgl. ebd. S. 287; (Teil 48\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) Alain de \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Libera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Leone \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gazziero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Le sophisma \u8222 \'84Omnis homo de necessitate est animal\ldblquote  du Parisinus Latinus 16135, f. 99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Archives d\rquote histoire doctrinale et litt\u233 \'e9raire du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge 75 (2008), S. 232-368, hierzu S. 332-368 (diese Hs. Sigle M), erg\u228 \'e4nzende Ausz\u252 \'fcge bei Alain de Libera, Faire de n\u233 \'e9cessit\u233 \'e9 loi. Th\u233 \'e9ories de la modalit\u233 \'e9 dans le sophisma \u8218 \'82Omnis homo de necessitate est animal\lquote  du Parisinus Latinus 16135, f\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  11rb-12rb, in: Archives d\rquote histoire doctrinale et litt\u233 \'e9raire du Moyen \u194 \'c2ge 76 (2009), S. 179-233, hierzu S. 198. \endash  Zum Textbestand vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faes de Mot\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 toni \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Aegidii Romani opera. Bd. 1,5,1 (wie oben), S. 146f. \endash  Zum Inhalt vgl. Andrea \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tabarroni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u8218 \'82Omnis phoenix est\lquote . Quantification and existence in a new sophismata-collection (MS Clm 14522), in: Sophisms in medieval logic and grammar. Acts of the Ninth European Symposium for Medieval logic and semantics, held at St Andrews, June 1990, hrsg. von Stephen \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Read\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Dordrecht/Boston/London 1993 (Nijhoff international philosophy series 48), S. 185-201 (mit einem weiteren Vorschlag zur urspr\u252 \'fcnglichen Lagenordnung, vgl. S. 200f.); Sten \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ebbesen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / Fr\u233 \'e9d\u233 \'e9ric \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Goubier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A catalogue of 13th-century sophismata. Bd. 1: Introduction and indices. Paris 2010 (Sic et non), S. 47f.}

