\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistulae decretaque summorum pontificum et patrum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Am rechten oberen Rand Eintrag 16. Jh.:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decreta qu\u230 \'e6dam Summorum pontificum et patrum. Sermo Ormiste pap\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  missus per uniuersas prouincias. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (16\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce manifestissime constat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 continere uidentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Caesarius Arelatensis, Epistula 14, in: Sancti Caesarii opera omnia, Bd. 2 (1942), ed. Germain \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Morin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 23-27); (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistula Gregorii ad Secundinum seruum Dei inclusum missa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[16].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctitas tua inde a nobis requisiuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui peccatores sanguine redimere uenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= S. Gregorii Magni Registrum epistularum VIII-XIV, Appendix, ed. Dag \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Norberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 140 A (1982), S. 1108-1110); (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Epistola Ysydori episcopi ad Masonem episcopum de restauratione sacerdotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De sancto meritisque beato fratri Masoni episcopo Isydorus episcopus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[22].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ueniente ad nos famulo nostro}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uiro religioso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cuius potior extat auctoritas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Data\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 anno IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regni domini Nitterici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 regis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Isidorus Hispalensis, Epistula ad Massonam episcopum, PL 83, 899-902; vgl. CPL 1209); (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In decretis Syricii PP. Cap. III. Quod non liceat alterius sponsam ad matrimonii ivra sortiri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De coniugali autem uelatione requisisti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Epistula I. Siricii Papae ad Himerium episcopum Tarraconensem, cap. 4, PL13, 1136f.); (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De ratione conivgvm Sancti Augustini. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[14].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qualis esse debet uxor que habenda est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= CICa, C.30 q.5 c.4); (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[12].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nolite uiri uobis habere uxores}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Ivo Carnotensis, Decretum, PL 161, 617f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item vnde supra sancti Augustini de conubiis. Quale est et illud quod multi uirorum ante nuptias concubinas sibi adhibere non erubescunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Egbertus Eboracensis, Excerptiones, PL 89, 394); (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De uxoribus non dimittendis Hieronimus in commentario sue Mathevm libro III\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , cap. XLVI inter cetera sic exponit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et accesserunt ad Iesum Pharisei temptantes eum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Hieronymus, Commentarii in Evangelium Matthaei, in: S. Hieronymi presbyteri opera 1,7, ed. David \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hurst\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / Marcus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Adriaen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 77 (1969), S. 165); (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De collatione III ad Theonem abbatem. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nec tamen ex eo debemus nos a dominica communione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Cassianus, Collationes, Ed.: CSEL 13, ed. Michael \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Petschenig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / Gottfried \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kreuz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 2004), S. 670, Coll. XXIII,21); (22\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Evcharistia. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[17].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctus Cyprianus dixit: eucharistia cottidie ad cibum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 salutis accipitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Cyprianus, De dominica oratione, c. 18, in: Sancti Cypriani episcopi opera, Bd. 2, ed. Claudio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Moreschini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 3A (1976), S. 101); (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De discretione corporis et sangvinis dominici. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In perceptione corporis et sanguinis dominici magna discretio adhibenda est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Konzil von Chalon 813, c. 46, in: MGH Conc. 2,1, ed. Albert \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Werminghoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1906), S. 283); (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De presbiteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diaconibus et reliquis ex clero ordinibus. Cap. CXXXIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[21].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Siluester papa urbis Rom\u281 \'ea cum Constantino imperatore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  ... sub cyrographo fecit hos gradus in gremio synodi, ut non presbyter aduersus episcopum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 res traditas recipiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Ansegisi abbatis capitularium collectio, c. 133-135, in: MGH Capit. 1, ed. Alfred \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Boretius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1883), S. 411f.); (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De infantibus incaute oppressis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[20].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si quis infantem suum incaute oppresserit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Konzil von Mainz 852, c. 9, in: MGH Conc. 3, ed. Wilfried \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hartmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1984), S. 247; (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Huic de capitulo consona dedit responsa}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 magister Rathramnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 h\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u252 \'fcbergeschrieben) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Percontrarius inquit de mulieribus que infantes suos in lecto mortuos inueniunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 meretur ultionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Ratramnus Corbiensis, De infantibus incaute oppressis, abgedruckt nach Vatikanstadt, BAV, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vat. lat. 973}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  bei Gerhard \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schmitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Schuld und Strafe. Eine unbekannte Stellungnahme des Rathramnus von Corbie zur Kindest\u246 \'f6tung, in: DA 38 (1982), S. 363-387, hierzu S. 384-387; (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sermo Sancti Augustini de decimis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[18].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scriptum est, fratres, domini est terra et plenitudo eius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quia te redimere noluisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo de decimis inferendis; Ed.: Sancti Caesarii Arelatensis Sermones, ed. German \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Morin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 103 (1953), Sermo 33, S. 143-145; vgl. CPPM 1A, 1680); (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De honore parentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[15].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qui honorat patrem iocundabitur in filiis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Sir 3,6-17); (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sacramentum quod Leo papa ivravit. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Auditum, fratres karissimi, et diuulgatum est per multa loca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Leo III., Ep. 6, in: MGH Epp. 5, ed. Karl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hampe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1889), S. 63f.); (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De incriminatis qualiter expurgari debeant. In synodo Aurelianensi in quo sederunt episcopi XLVIIII Cap. XIIII. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[19].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si episcopo aut presbytero causa criminalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 reputatum fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Konzil von Worms 868, c. 42, in: MGH Conc. 4, ed. Wilfried \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hartmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1984), S. 281 mit Anm. 55); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De regulis patrum. Cap. XLII Pro litigosis clericis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eius qui frequenter litigat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Capitula Angilramni, c. 50; Ed.: Karl-Georg \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Capitula Angilramni. Eine prozessrechtliche F\u228 \'e4lschung Pseudoisidors. Hannover 2006 (MGH Studien und Texte 39), S. 149); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. XLV. De discordantibus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[13].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oblationes dissidentium fratrum neque in sacrario neque in gazophilatio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  recipiantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= CICa D. 90 c.2) ... \endash  ... (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in synodo pro facto dabunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De his qui falso accusant fratres suos. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In synodo Arelatensi sub Maurino episcopo et Constantino}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Konzil von Arles 314, can. 15, in: Concilia Gallia A. 314-A. 506, ed. Charles \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Munier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , CCL 148 (1963), S. 12); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Vnde supra. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In synodo Matiscense in quo sederunt episcopi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Id etiam pari cohibentia placuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 a communione priuetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= Synode von M\u226 \'e2con 583, c. 18, 19, in: MGH Conc. 1, ed. Friedrich \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Maassen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1893), S. 159f.); (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. LXII {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clericum inter temptationes ab officio suo declinantem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Friedberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sp. 270f.); (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cap. LXV. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Clericum inter epulas cantantem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Statuta ecclesiae antiqua, can. 75, in: Concilia Gallia, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Munier\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (wie oben), S. 178) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De regulis patrum. Eorum qui pauperes opprimunt donaria sacerdotibus refutanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ebd., can. 69, S. 177).}

