\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schule des Anselmus Laudunensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Neue Passauer Sammlung\lquote  (Gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec sunt excerpta sanctorum patrum ex auct\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 oritatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 lib\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 collecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quod presbyteri excommunicati uel heretici uel scismatici possunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominicum corpus consecrare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 uti possunt liber arbitrio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
