\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber primvs aeditionis primae commentorvm Boetii in ysagogas Porphyrii. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hiemantis anni tempore in Av<reliae montibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si enim prius dixeris hominem rem minorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //, bricht ab. \endash  Text durch Vertauschung beider Bl\u246 \'f6cke in Unordnung geraten. \endash  66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und 67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
