\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit poetria nouella Magistri Gaufredi Anglici.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Papa stupor mundi si dixero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Flexibilis et sit ei melius ratione potentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Exest librum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Amen. Qui me scribebat Burcardus nomen habebat. Finito libro sit laus et gloria Christo. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<
