\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 In dei nomine de metrica ratione pauca incipiunt ex multis grammaticorum libris excerpta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Discite me pueri uersus si scribere uultis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nam ueterum rite carmina prisca sequor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Dist.), daneben mit Bleistift \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 = Clm 6411 fol. 82\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  von Wilhelm Meyer. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Omnibus metrice artis notitiam desiderantibus necesse est ut ordinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quot s\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs24 unt cessur\u281 \'ea uersuum. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pentimemeris eptimemeris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /, bricht ab; vgl. Tinteneintrag von Docen \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 hic est defectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
