\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Invocatio \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Assit principio sancta Maria meo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Consequenter queritur utrum circa minorem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  edicionem ipsius Donati de octo partibus oracionis possit esse sciencia et videtur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Donatus autem considerans quod in termino adderet super modum determinantis fieri affectionem ideo eam sub distincta parte collocauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt bone questiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Spaltenf\u252 \'fcllsel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Alia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Q]ueritur vtrum sacerdos possit absoluere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a peccatis. Quod non probo quia dominus dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego sum qui dimitto peccatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad argumentum dico verum et principaliter sed tamen potuit instrvmentaliter et vt minister \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 //, bricht ab.}

