\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Vgl. Robert Dale \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sweeney\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Prolegomena to an edition of the scholia to Statius. Leiden 1969 (Mnemosyne Suppl. 8), S. 22 Hs. \u8222 \'84contains condensed excerpts from the Lactantius Placidus with some interpolations. Perhaps these were drawn from the margin of some manuscript of the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20 Thebaid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 .\ldblquote  \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Munk Olsen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote \u233 \'e9tude 2, S. 564f. Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt, aber mit einem Schluss, der sich auf das \u252 \'fcbern\u228 \'e4chste St\u252 \'fcck bezieht.}

