\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Buchtitel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Liber Alcimi Auiti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13. Jh.). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit liber Alcimi Aviti Vihennensis episcopi de initio mvndi. Quicquid agit uarios humana in gente labores \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /< ..., am Ende drei abecedarische Verse \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Alcimus h\u281 \'eac lubrico texi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 [t] \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea carmina uersu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Binis iam breuibus sed sena uolumina pennis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conscripsi en celeris deno sub lumine solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  199\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer au\u223 \'dfer Federproben. 
