\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r-v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Synagoga dominum venire in carne desiderat}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 congrua laude decantans \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Ed., S. 181f.: capitula I-XXII); (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Prologus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cantica canticorum in quibus sapientissimus regum ... describit}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 ac saluatoris sui desiderare presentiam dicens \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Ed., S. 190); Haupttext: (2\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -56\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 Vox sinagoge\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oscvletvr me oscvlo oris svi}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 merentur montes aromatum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ; Textbestand: (1\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -15\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch I, (15\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -23\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch II, (24\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -34\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch III, (34\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -45\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch IIII, (45\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 -56\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 ) Buch V, jeweils mit unvollst\u228 \'e4ndigem Text (Fehlen einzelner Abschnitte), besonders stark gek\u252 \'fcrzten Text weist das vierte Buch auf, das sechste Buch fehlt g\u228 \'e4nzlich; 56\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
