\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sanftl III,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  p. 1712f. \endash  Aegidii Romani Opera omnia. Catalogo dei manoscritti (457-505). Bd. 1,5,1: Repubblica Federale di Germania (Monaco), ed. Barbara \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Faes de Mottoni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Florenz 1990 (Corpus philosophorum medii aevi. Testi e studi 10), S.\~141-145 Nr. 482. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hernad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Got. Hss. 1, S.\~209 Nr. 290.}

