\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Humanum genus duobus regitur videlicet iure naturaliter et moribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Distinctio prima. Prima docet leges\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ille me clarificabit quia de meo accipiet etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit iste liber scriptor sit crimine liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Centum sunt et tres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Si numeras recte sunt sex trigintaque cause\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5686/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iste liber scriptus est Ratispone anno domini MoCCCoXXXV}}\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< Kompendium zum Decretum Gratiani mit einleitenden Merkversen.
