\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit tractatus sancti Augustini de sermone domini in monte habito ex evangelio sancti Mathei. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermonem,< quem locutus est Iesus Christus in monte}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 si uolumus edificare super petram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
