\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Giovanni Boccaccio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De claris mulieribus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Widmungsbrief: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohannes Bocacii de Certaldo mulieri clarissime Andree Acciacolis de Florencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pridie, mulierum egregia, paululum ab inerti uulgo semotus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vorrede: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Iohannes Bocacii de Certaldo de mulieribus claris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 liber incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica secunda et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scripsere iam dudum nonnulli veterum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Hauptteil: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De Eua parente seu matre prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Rubrica III\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scripturus igitur quibus fulgoribus mulieres claruerint insignes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 dentibus in uidorum depereat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Expliciunt epistole de mulieribus claris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sequitur registrum rubricarum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<; (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Rubrikenregister.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Vittorio \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zaccaria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Tutte le opere di Boccaccio X: De mulieribus claris. Mailand \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 1970 (I classici Mondadori) (diese Hs. Sigle Mc\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Zur \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Vittore \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Branca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Tradizione delle opere di Giovanni Boccaccio. Raccolta di studi e testi. Bd. 1. Rom 1958 (Storia e letteratura 66), S. 92-98, hierzu S. 94 (diese Hs. Sigle Mc\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  Zum Verh\u228 \'e4ltnis des Textes dieser Hs. zur deutschen \u220 \'dcbersetzung Heinrich Steinh\u246 \'f6wels vgl. Boccaccio, De claris mulieribus. Deutsch \u252 \'fcbersetzt von Stainh\u246 \'f6wel, ed. Karl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Drescher\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . T\u252 \'fcbingen 1895 (Bibliothek des Litterarischen Vereins in Stuttgart 205), S. XX (diese Hs. Sigle M 3).}

