\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Incipit epistula beati Iohannis apostoli. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Quod fuit< ab initio (I Io 1,1)}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et precepta ei facimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Io 5,2), folgt Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hvc vsque tractauit hanc epistolam sanctus Augustinus episcopus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...; folgt Schluss des Johannesbriefes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Hec est enim dilectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I Io 5,3) ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 custodite uos a simulacris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= I Io 5,21). R\u246 \'f6mische Z\u228 \'e4hlung in Rot am Rand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 III\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 X\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 XV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
