\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iudicii signum tellus sudore madescit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 9907 und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schaller/K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 nsgen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  8495) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Denariis XXX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ta\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deum vendit Galileus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 4248), teilweise quer am Rand, Anschluss durch Verweiszeichen angezeigt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 forte putas lector\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 discere facta remota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; unterbrochen ist das zweite Gedicht durch vier Epigramme: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De X preceptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sperne deos fugite periuria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 18485), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De decem plagis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Prima rubens unda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 14595); in Glossenschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 De VII bonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 A timet et pauper regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 96); folgt Eintrag in Glossenschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 turpiter inuentum zelo iusto leuitate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: Clm 28610, 17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota subsequentes versus. Iussu diuino cum missa pie celebratur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 9993) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Quociens deus quocumque flagello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Isidor, Sententiae 1,10,18, vgl. Migne PL 83, Sp. 556f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Roma docente Petro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 famulatur credula Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 16846); (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nobilitas hominis mens est deitatis ymago}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 11860); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nil artes, nil pacta fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proverbia 16675); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Roma sitit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 16864); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Ut cecus uideat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Miles gloriosus, v. 303f.; Ed.: Silvana \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Pareto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in: Commedie latine del XII e XIII secolo, Bd. 4, Genua 1983 (Pubblicazioni dell\rquote Istituto di Filologia Classica e Medioevale 79), S. 58-92, hierzu S. 86); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Orphanus absque parente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pupillus stat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (nicht nachweisbar); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Postumus est dictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (nicht nachweisbar); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Tullius in libro de amicitia: Omnibus rebus humanis preponenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Cicero, Laelius 17); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Nota de sobrietate. Quod sobrietas ualet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Guilelmus Peraldus, Summa de vitiis et virtutibus, vgl. GW 12054-12057 = BSB-Ink G-524-527); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Spes est certa expectatio future\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Petrus Lombardus, Liber sententiarum III,26,1; Ed.: Magistri Petri Lombardi Sententiae in IV libris distinctae. Bd. 2, Rom 1981 (Spicilegium Bonaventurianum 5), S. 159); (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non diuturnitas temporum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (vgl. Magistri Alexandri de Hales Quaestiones Disputatae \u8218 \'82Antequam esset frater\lquote , Bd. 1. Florenz 1960, S. 421 und 433); (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scientia est nobilis animi possessio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (= Johannes Dacus, Divisio Scientie; Ed.: Johannis Daci Opera. Bd. 1,1, ed. Alfredus\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Otto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Kopenhagen 1955 (Corpus philosophorum Danicorum medii aevi 1), S. 10), in Klammerform daneben und darunter Exzerpt aus Bibelkommentar, Inc.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Correxit deus Iudam tripliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

