\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Nicolaus Vulpes Uicentinus.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Explicit a teneris nimio succensus amore}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... Hunc et Nasonem turba procax celebret.
