\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Lasterkatalog aus dem Speculum virginum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Superbia est singularis excellencie super alios cecus quidam appetitus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Sed nunc ad fructum meliorem procedamus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Rest der Lage unbeschriftet.
