\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Brunellus de diuersis ordinibus. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sed quia diuerse species sunt religionis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et fratres humili sollicitare prece\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Folgen aristotelische Sinnspr\u252 \'fcche: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Racio semper deprecatur ad omnia, actus perficit habitum, virtus hominem bonum et opus eius laudabile redit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (vgl. Aristoteles, Ethica Nicomachea 2,6) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Franciscus Petrarcha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Credere se sapientem primus ad stulticiam gradus est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. Francesco Petrarca, De remediis utriusque fortunae, 1, Dial. 12,8; Ed.: Francesco Petrarca, Rimedi all\rquote una e all\rquote altra fortuna, ed. Enrico \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Fenzio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Neapel 2009 (Umanesimo e Rinascimento 1), S. 96).
