\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Heinricus Samariensis poeta< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quomodo sola sedet probitas}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 quam morientis amor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit Heinrici liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 qui fuit arte sequens. Explicit pauper Heinricus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in die S. Mathie appostoli anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 sexagesimo sexto \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= 24. Februar 1466); 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
