\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sanftl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  IV, p. 9. \endash  Caspar Renatus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gregory\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Novum Testamentum graece. Ad antiquissimos testes denuo recensuit, apparatum criticum omni studio perfectum apposuit commentationem isagogicam. Bd. 3: Prolegomena. Leipzig 1894, S. 1081, Nr. 1774.}

