\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rex pacificus cunctorum casus effectiua et finalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Saluo iure addendi mutandi corrigendi etc. ut moris est. Et sic finitus est processus ordinis iudicarij, anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 cccclxx\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  viii augusti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 (= 8.\~August 1470); folgen einige Notae zum kanonischen Recht: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Experientia est efficax rerum magistra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (= CICa. VI, I, VI, 6) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Item forma litigandi et placitandi inuenta est in paradiso per Adam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 item S. Paulus apparuit de iudicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ; 128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 Druck: Ioannis Urbach Processus iudicii qui Panormitani ordo iudiciarius a multis dicitur, ed. Theodor \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Muther.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Halle/Saale 1873 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Vgl. Hartmut \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bo\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ockmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 VL 10 (1999), Sp. 117\endash 121, zu diesem Werk Sp. 119.}

